tyle=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"triggers_new_gtin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"list_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.29</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"triggers_new_gtin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"package_design_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"triggers_new_gtin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"decision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new_gtin_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"flavour is a variant-defining attribute that forms a distinct trade item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"new_gtin14\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"06901234500192\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"allocate_from_pool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PRD-BEV-POOL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"retire_old_gtin14\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>retire_old_gtin14: false</code>——风味变更不是「旧号作废」，两件商品会同时在售。<strong>换号与退役是两件不同的事</strong>：换号是「新品用新号」，退役是「旧商品不再生产，这个号从此不用」。把两者混为一谈会导致历史数据断链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退役与回收窗口\">退役与回收窗口</h3><p>一个 GTIN 一旦用于某件实物商品，它就必须能<strong>长期唯一地指向那件商品</strong>——因为零售 POS 系统、渠道历史订单、消费者保留的包装、监管留档都可能在未来引用它。因此不能「不用了就回收」。</p>\n<p>工程上必须为每个 GTIN 维护 <code>allocated_at</code> 与 <code>retired_at</code> 两个时间戳，并在退役后设置<strong>冷却期</strong>（reuse cooldown）。冷却期的意义是：等所有可能引用该号的下游系统（渠道的在售目录、POS 历史、退货系统、监管档案）都已不再需要它。业内普遍采用的窗口量级是数年（例如以 48 个月为安全下界），但<strong>具体期限应以你所签署的 GS1 成员组织条款为准</strong>——不同成员组织与不同品类（尤其食品、医药）的要求可能更严，不能把某个数字当成全球统一标准。</p>\n<p>回收动作本身要受控：<code>retired_at + cooldown</code> 未到之前，系统必须<strong>硬拒绝</strong>任何对该号的重新分配尝试；冷却期满后，回收也只能进入<strong>备号池</strong>而不是静默复用，且重新启用必须在审计日志中记录原因与审批人。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 发号与回收：把冷却期约束写进约束本身，而不是靠流程纪律&#10;ALTER TABLE product_identity_gtin&#10;  ADD CONSTRAINT no_reuse_in_cooldown CHECK (&#10;    retired_at IS NULL&#10;    OR retired_at + INTERVAL &#39;48 months&#39; &lt;= now()::date&#10;    OR retired_at &gt; now()::date          -- 已退役但未到期：仅可读&#10;  );&#10;&#10;-- 发号器：只从未退役、且已过冷却期的号中取，取不到就报错而不是静默跳号&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION allocate_gtin(p_pool text, p_item_ref char(8))&#10;RETURNS char(14) LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$&#10;DECLARE v_prefix varchar(12); v_gtin char(14);&#10;BEGIN&#10;  SELECT company_prefix INTO v_prefix FROM gtin_prefix_pool&#10;   WHERE pool_code = p_pool AND closed_at IS NULL ORDER BY random() LIMIT 1;&#10;  IF v_prefix IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;pool % exhausted&#39;, p_pool; END IF;&#10;  v_gtin := lpad(v_prefix || p_item_ref, 13, &#39;0&#39;);&#10;  v_gtin := v_gtin || gs1_check_digit(v_gtin);&#10;  INSERT INTO product_identity_gtin(gtin14, indicator, company_prefix, prefix_len,&#10;         item_ref, brand_owner_gln, allocated_at)&#10;  VALUES (v_gtin, left(v_gtin,1), v_prefix, length(v_prefix), p_item_ref,&#10;          current_setting(&#39;app.brand_gln&#39;), now()::date);&#10;  RETURN v_gtin;&#10;EXCEPTION WHEN unique_violation THEN&#10;  RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;item_ref % already used under prefix %&#39;, p_item_ref, v_prefix;&#10;END $$;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 发号与回收：把冷却期约束写进约束本身，而不是靠流程纪律</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_identity_gtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> no_reuse_in_cooldown </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retired_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4